<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sowits half yr shr up, to hold rights offer.</title>
<headline>Sowits half yr shr up, to hold rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     0.62 profit vs 1.45 loss</p>
<p>    Net earnings	    0.22 profit vs 0.52 loss</p>
<p>    Operating loss	  0.16	  vs 0.48</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.05	  vs 0.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		  none	  vs none</p>
<p>Full name: Southern Witwatersrand Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>Share of associates'  0.34 profit vs 0.07 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said the company intends proceeding with a rights offer, details of which will be published on October 28 and 30. Shareholders must be registered on November 1 in order to participate. Details of the offer , they said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
